                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Drill-through is enabled for visualisations that contains owners or property addresses, or where indicated on the report subtitle. Right-click on the row to drill-through and see greater detail for the record or year you have selected."
